  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- Several run-throughs of this song appear, including three partial takes, in what is described as a practice session [1]\n- Most of the material consists of a few takes of this song [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **full song**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **partial x 3**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **full song**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **talking (very low volume)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **gd1966-03-10.136655.sbd.sirmick.flac16** (recommended): soundboard; 4 songs; 14 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Very clear, crisp and energetic soundboard recording of a rehearsal-style session [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Location is given as possibly Owsley's house in Watts; the recording is a practice session [1]\n- Discussion on the final track is faintly audible with headphones and good amplification [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **gd1966-03-10.136655.sbd.sirmick.flac16**: taped by Anonomous; transferred by SIRMick; source: Source: sbd > 7 inch Master Reel @ 7.5ips 1/2 track > dat(48k) [1]. Also: This version came from an anonymous source [1]",
